{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, there are no naive, sweet girls. You\u2019ll need real charm and skills to win a girl\u2019s heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Are you struggling with romance?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Are you frustrated by failed relationships?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd39 Have you wasted money on expensive &quot;pickup artist&quot; guides?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those beautiful, unpredictable, emotion-driven women\u2014experienced, treating love like a game\u2014always keep you guessing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe all you need is one crucial experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game won\u2019t spoon-feed you answers, but if you play to the end, you\u2019ll gain valuable dating insights\u2014potentially saving you time and boosting your real-life success rate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Decrypt, battle, and conquer\u2014this game offers a perfect blend of challenge and fun! (Warning: not for casual couch potatoes!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Grab your mouse, click &amp; drag like a pro, and show off your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 Multiple save slots \u2013 More than one ending.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Check the forum for game guides/walkthroughs.</i></h2>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rat","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625600/3ca117e25ca5560fbeda66b03eb1045d431a304e.jpg"},{"name":"Want to Marry","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625600/195217fcaf0a6388dd1abe48afdb1518908c1835.jpg"},{"name":"Inferiority","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3625600/55afe01670e10ba4a6db6d4a0